{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00966",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.58,
      "end_seconds": 13.05,
      "duration_seconds": 10.47,
      "text": "Hello. Um. I've come for a review, and, um, I wanted to ask what I was supposed to bring. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.61,
      "end_seconds": 21.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Just yourself, that's fine. So what's been going on? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.32,
      "end_seconds": 38.98,
      "duration_seconds": 14.66,
      "text": "I've been getting wheezy, a lot more lately. Maybe three or four times a week, mostly when I go up the stairs at work."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.34,
      "end_seconds": 50.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.72,
      "text": "Three or four times a week. How long has it been like that? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.29,
      "end_seconds": 59.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "A while. A month? I can't remember. I wrote it somewhere. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.22,
      "end_seconds": 67.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "That's fine. Does anything bring it on? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.07,
      "end_seconds": 75.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Stairs, cold air, the dog next door. I don't know. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.86,
      "end_seconds": 82.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "How do you feel afterwards? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.03,
      "end_seconds": 91.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Out of puff, and then I'm okay. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.53,
      "end_seconds": 100.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "And how's your sleep, does it wake you? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.72,
      "end_seconds": 106.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Not really. Sometimes. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.29,
      "end_seconds": 117.48,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "I'd like you to do something for me. Keep a short diary for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.97,
      "end_seconds": 124.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "A diary? What do I put in it? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.19,
      "end_seconds": 135.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.87,
      "text": "Each time you wheeze, write the time, what you were doing, and how long it lasted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.7,
      "end_seconds": 141.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "I'll try. I'll probably lose it. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.82,
      "end_seconds": 151.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Put it on your phone, in your notes. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.99,
      "end_seconds": 156.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Oh. That's easier. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.45,
      "end_seconds": 172.63,
      "duration_seconds": 13.18,
      "text": "Also, I'd like you to bring everything you use for it when you come back, so we can go through each item together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.04,
      "end_seconds": 178.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Everything. Okay. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.59,
      "end_seconds": 191.24,
      "duration_seconds": 9.65,
      "text": "And think about whether anything at work could be setting it off, dust or cleaning products. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.83,
      "end_seconds": 198.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "There's a new cleaner on the stairs, actually. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.37,
      "end_seconds": 205.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "That's worth noting down. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.65,
      "end_seconds": 212.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "I'll put it in the diary. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.02,
      "end_seconds": 220.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Do you have any questions about it? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.1,
      "end_seconds": 228.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "I wanted to ask about running. Can I still? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.8,
      "end_seconds": 241.76,
      "duration_seconds": 8.96,
      "text": "Gentle exercise is good for you. Warm up slowly, and don't run in very cold air. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.23,
      "end_seconds": 246.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "That's helpful. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.52,
      "end_seconds": 258.57,
      "duration_seconds": 9.05,
      "text": "Right. I'd like to see you again in four weeks, with the diary and all of your things."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.05,
      "end_seconds": 265.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Four weeks. Where do I write that? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.79,
      "end_seconds": 272.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "The receptionist will give you a card. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.89,
      "end_seconds": 279.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Okay. I'll ask her. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.83,
      "end_seconds": 287.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Anything else for today? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.01,
      "end_seconds": 293.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "No. I think that's all. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.87,
      "end_seconds": 299.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Good. Take care. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.57,
      "end_seconds": 306.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Thanks, doctor. Bye. ~"
    }
  ]
}
